      "TEXT": "We\u0027ve got all types of goods!",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Zimraan\u0027s Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I have much magic of an infernal origin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Breasal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uallgarg",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Known in his times as the mightiest of all adepts of the black art, this lord was slain by the inquisitor Vorgel who ended his reign of terror. He is now resurrected as an undead with the intention to subjugate every mortal to his will.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cathal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Conall",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Polar Bear",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Kraken Appears",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022Milord! We have awakened a monster from the deep! We must flee!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Fendhil",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022The name Krath\u0027du... It brings forth horrible memories of pain and suffering!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Rivend Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022We have heard the name Krath\u0027du before. It is said that during the years of terror, upon pillaging a village, he took pity on a young bride...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022She was beautiful, and with child, and so instead of murdering her - he embraced her with death\u0027s cloak! But the girl\u0027s body, feeling the unborn child resist the vampirish invasion, could not be converted... and so the young bride expired.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022That story! It sounds...  All too familiar... \u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Kekkut",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022You will pay for your invasion of this Clan! May the demons you search for consume you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Kalajit",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022The Clans will have your hides for what you\u0027ve done! No Demon\u0027s search can justify this devastation... You will pay for this!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Approaching Rivend Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022We are approaching the city of Rivend, Milord. It has been heavily fortified, and resisted for years the attacks of the Undead. It will not be easy to capture, for the inhabitants are familiar with war!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Approaching Undead Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022This is the entrance to Undead territory, Milord. Be cautious! The creatures of the night are very dangerous...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Lookout Tower Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022I see an inscription written in the tower; but only part of the text remains intact... It reads: \n\u0027And when the Nosferat Krath\u0027du did lay eyes on the lady, the Nosferat did say unto her: Be mine.\u0027  \nWhat could these lines indicate, Milord?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Abandoned Shelter Em",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022A bear has taken sanctuary here most recently, but the overwhelming presence of death remains and skulls line the back wall. There is no doubt that a Vampire has taken shelter here!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Alchemist\u0027s Lab Empi",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022There is no evidence that Krath\u0027du had dealings with the Dwarves, Milord... Only the usual Clan magical implements have been found.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Ruined Castle Emp 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Krath\u0027du \n\u0022I have been waiting so long for you, Drega Zul...  We must be together, do you understand? It is our destiny to rule these lands - together!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Empire has found Krath\u0027du, Master... We must capture him immediately, lest the feeble Empire troops allow him to escape!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day After Loot Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sir Geldwin \n\u0022We understand that you have lost a valuable leader! We are here to replace your losses, Milord.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Master! The insane Nosferat Krath\u0027du has fled the capital! He left during the day, with soldiers loyal to his cause... His servants say that he has left, seeking out his true mate:  the wretched half-Human half-Undead that he created - Drega Zul!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Many years ago, he attempted to convert the creature\u0027s mortal mother, while she carried the child. Of course, the unborn mortal flesh was transformed into the monstrosity that it is now. We must stop him before he spreads The Dark Gift any further!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022Milord, I have trained with you and served you loyally for years now. The time has come for me to avenge the death of my father...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022He was horribly slaughtered many years ago by the Nosferat who made me the aberration I am... I must vindicate his death! I implore you, help me find this Demon!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022She is right, Milord. We should be escalating our war against the Undead forces. They have committed countless atrocities against our people, and they must now feel our wrath!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lookout Tower Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022This tower is off-limits to Empire soldiers!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lookout Tower Undead",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022Alert! Ready weapons! Undead attack!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Approaching Rivend Undead",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearmen Guards \n\u0022Sound the alarm! Undead are approaching! Alert the Mages!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0036",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rivend Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans Pass",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rock Giant \n\u0022This is Clans territory, you have no business here... Turn back or face consequences!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Approaching Fendhil Emp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022Stay away from our city, Empire soldier! Our people live freed of your tyranny!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Approaching Fendhil Undea",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022Do not imagine that the people of this city will allow themselves to be defeated! Prepare to die, Undead swine!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN003c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hermit Sacred Grounds",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hermit \n\u0022The unpure of heart may not walk upon this sacred resting place! It is reserved for Wotan\u0027s chosen warriors... I will cleanse these grounds of your presence!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire Attacks Undead",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022May the forces of light destroy you, filthy Undead!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolf beast warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Milord, the locals have a superstition about a wolf-beast inhabiting this area\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Day 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Our informant on the Undead side has notified us, it seems that a certain Lord Krath\u0027du has recently disappeared... This may be the cruel butcher we search for!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0041",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Abandoned Shelter Un",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Krath\u0027du has been here! He has lined the walls with skulls from his feedings. However, there doesn\u0027t seem to be any indication of where he was headed...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Alchemist\u0027s Lab Unde",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Nothing here, Master. Only simple Dwarven magic goods.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Ruined Castle Und 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Krath\u0027du \n\u0022Do not think your archaic ways will save you now, Undead soldiers! I am creating a new, superior race with my beloved - Drega Zul. I await her, and when she comes, you will all perish!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0044",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Undead forces have located Krath\u0027du! Let us move in for the attack!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Ruined Castle Emp 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Transformed Drega Zul \n\u0022I understand now, my Krath\u0027du... It is our destiny to be together.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord! The evil Krath\u0027du has been planning this all along - to lure us into this trap and ensorcell Drega Zul! Even though we are weakened, we must persist... We must kill Krath\u0027du to break the spell he has set on her!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Do not despair, I have called for reinforcements, Milord.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215UN0049",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Attack Rivend Guards1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022Now that we\u0027ve struck the first blow, the Humans will likely retaliate... We should leave the area if we are not ready for war!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Attack Rivend Guards2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drega Zul \n\u0022Now that we\u0027ve struck the first blow, the Humans will likely retaliate... We should leave the area if we are not ready for war!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Rivend Undead",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022These Humans know of Krath\u0027du\u0027s deeds... He may have infected more innocents than we realized! We should pursue our efforts.\u0022",
