      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV0029",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Master, these villagers know nothing of Krath\u0027du\u0027s current deeds... He has not been seen here for many years now.\u0022",
