    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S215SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S215EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor\r\u0022Krath\u0027du still lives, and he will never rest until he has made right the death of Drega Zul. He will shatter the organization within The Undead Hordes, to avenge this! We must now concentrate on protecting ourselves..\u0022\r \n",
